{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"lashana-lynch","name":"Lashana Lynch","birthDate":"1987-11-27","birthPlace":"London, England, UK","bio":"Lashana Lynch (born 27 November 1987) is a British actress. She first gained recognition for her role as Rosaline Capulet in the ABC period drama series Still Star-Crossed (2017), going on to win the BAFTA Rising Star Award in 2022. She has had roles in the James Bond film No Time to Die (2021), Matilda the Musical (2022), The Woman King (2022), and Bob Marley: One Love (2024), as well as the television series Day of the Jackal(2024). She has since portrayed Maria Rambeau in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU) beginning with Captain Marvel (2019).\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Lashana Lynch, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:47:25+00:00","tmdbId":1360281,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1360281","credits":[{"id":"captain-marvel","title":"Captain Marvel","character":"Maria Rambeau","characterFa":"ماریا رامبو"},{"id":"strange-mom","title":"Doctor Strange in the Multiverse of Madness","character":"Captain Marvel","characterFa":"کاپیتان مارول"},{"id":"marvels","title":"The Marvels","character":"Maria Rambeau","characterFa":"ماریا رامبو"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/lashana-lynch.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Children of Blood and Bone","year":2027,"character":"Jumoke","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qxUPu92DF5Bo6jcCDhnMTHFPEEc.jpg"},{"name":"Letters to My Younger Future Self","year":2026,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":""},{"name":"Bob Marley: One Love","year":2024,"character":"Rita Marley","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1lQftpEARVVB9op4TaYiIbactzG.jpg"},{"name":"The Day of the Jackal","year":2024,"character":"Bianca Pullman","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tYLecM3WSEjlkKhkGiH5G68Dprm.jpg"},{"name":"The Marvels","year":2023,"c